Subject: [PATCH] MASpigot Add chunk snapshot test command

Adds an operator-only /chunksnapshot command with per-player copy, paste, and clear actions. Snapshots include tile entities and can be pasted into another chunk for manual testing. Also clears destination tile entities when the copied snapshot contains none.

